---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home',           item: 'https://yonolink.co' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Privacy Policy', item: 'https://yonolink.co/privacy-policy' },
  ],
};
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — How YonoLink Handles Your Data" description="Privacy policy for YonoLink — how we collect, use, store and protect your information. Learn what data we gather, how it is used and your rights as a visitor to this site." schema={breadcrumbSchema}>
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Overview</h2>
        <p>YonoLink.co ("we", "us", or "our") is committed to protecting the privacy of visitors to this website. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit yonolink.co, how we use it, and the choices you have regarding your data. By continuing to use this site, you agree to the practices described in this policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the site.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We do not require you to create an account or submit personal information to browse this website. The information we may collect falls into two categories:</p>
        <p class="mt-3"><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Usage and Technical Data.</span> When you visit the site, our hosting provider and analytics tools may automatically record certain technical information. This includes your IP address (in anonymised or truncated form), browser type and version, operating system, referring URL, pages visited, time spent on pages, and the date and time of your visit. This data is collected in aggregate and is not linked to any personally identifiable individual.</p>
        <p class="mt-3"><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Information You Voluntarily Provide.</span> If you choose to contact us via email or Telegram, we will receive whatever personal information you include in your message — such as your name, email address, or the contents of your enquiry. We use this information solely to respond to you and do not store it in any marketing database.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>The information we collect is used for the following purposes only:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the website and its content.</li>
          <li>To understand how visitors interact with the site so we can make it more useful and relevant.</li>
          <li>To respond to enquiries, feedback, or support requests you send us directly.</li>
          <li>To monitor for technical errors, security incidents, or abuse.</li>
          <li>To comply with any applicable legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">We do not sell, rent, trade, or otherwise transfer your information to third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>This website may use cookies — small text files placed on your device — to enhance your browsing experience and collect anonymised usage statistics. Cookies used on this site may include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Strictly necessary cookies</span> — required for the site to function correctly.</li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Analytics cookies</span> — used to count visits and understand how users navigate the site (e.g., via a service such as Google Analytics or a privacy-first alternative). We configure analytics tools to anonymise IP addresses wherever possible.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Disabling certain cookies may affect site functionality. Most browsers allow you to refuse or delete cookies; please refer to your browser's help documentation for instructions.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>YonoLink.co contains links to third-party websites, including gaming apps, download platforms, and referral partners. These links are provided for your convenience and information only. We have no control over the content, privacy practices, or security of those external sites. Clicking a third-party link will take you away from our site, and you do so at your own risk. We strongly encourage you to read the privacy policy of every site you visit. We are not responsible for the practices of any third-party website.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Data Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable precautions to protect the information we hold. The site is served over HTTPS to encrypt data in transit. We do not store payment information or sensitive personal data on our servers. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure. While we strive to protect your information, we cannot guarantee absolute security and accept no liability for unauthorised access beyond our reasonable control.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>This website is intended exclusively for adults aged 18 and above. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under the age of 18. If you believe a minor has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately at the details below and we will take steps to delete that information promptly.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain anonymised analytics data for as long as is necessary to fulfil the purposes described in this policy and to comply with applicable laws. Personal information provided through direct contact (such as email) is retained only for as long as needed to resolve your enquiry, after which it is deleted or anonymised.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on applicable law, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information we hold about you. To make such a request, please contact us using the details below. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe. Because we collect very limited personal data, we may not hold identifiable information about you at all.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, technology, or legal requirements. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this page periodically. Your continued use of the site after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions, concerns, or requests relating to this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Email:</span> Yonolinksupportcenter@gmail.com</li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-300 font-semibold">Telegram:</span> <a href="https://t.me/Lakshymi" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">t.me/Lakshymi</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">We aim to respond to all privacy-related enquiries within 7 business days.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
